<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In When Long Helps Short: How Context Length in Supervised Fine-tuning Affects Behavior of Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Analysis on Mixing Ratios</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A9" title="In When Long Helps Short: How Context Length in Supervised Fine-tuning Affects Behavior of Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I </span>Analysis on Various Types of Factual Knowledge</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
